@startuml Rule Update
title Update Rule Interface Activity Diagram

start

:Receive PUT /api/rules/{ruleId} request;
:Parse path parameters and request body RuleQO;

:Validate parameters;
note right: All fields are optional, only provided fields will be updated

if (Parameter validation passed?) then (no)
  :Return 400 error;
  stop
endif

:Convert to Rule model;
:Call RuleService.updateRule();

:Query if rule exists;
if (Rule does not exist?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 error;
  stop
endif

:Check if status changed;
if (Status changed?) then (yes)
  :Validate status transition;
  if (Status transition invalid?) then (yes)
    :Return 400 error;
    stop
  endif
  :Handle status change business logic;
endif

:Update RuleEntity (only update provided fields);
:Update RuleContentEntity (if content provided);
:Convert to RuleDTO;
:Return 200 OK;

stop

@enduml
